1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,230
You decided to let Safwan see it for himself.

2
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:04,030
It worked.

3
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:05,652
That was the problem.

4
00:00:05,962 --> 00:00:07,542
You don't answer the stranger.

5
00:00:07,592 --> 00:00:08,617
You say,

6
00:00:08,667 --> 00:00:09,007
Safwan.

7
00:00:09,057 --> 00:00:10,291
Look at the mirror.

8
00:00:10,341 --> 00:00:10,886
But first,

9
00:00:10,936 --> 00:00:11,836
you step back.

10
00:00:11,886 --> 00:00:13,266
Out of the glass.

11
00:00:13,417 --> 00:00:14,367
Safwan looks.

12
00:00:14,417 --> 00:00:15,037
Stairs.

13
00:00:15,087 --> 00:00:15,697
Railing.

14
00:00:15,747 --> 00:00:16,347
Candle.

15
00:00:16,397 --> 00:00:17,728
His own face.

16
00:00:17,878 --> 00:00:19,229
No stranger.

17
00:00:19,619 --> 00:00:21,813
His hand finds his whistle.

18
00:00:21,863 --> 00:00:23,565
The stranger smiles.

19
00:00:23,615 --> 00:00:24,060
Clever.

20
00:00:24,110 --> 00:00:25,823
Now he knows what I am.

21
00:00:25,873 --> 00:00:28,988
Let's see how long until he knows what you are.

22
00:00:29,138 --> 00:00:30,383
The whistle screams.

23
00:00:30,433 --> 00:00:32,123
He backs up the stairs.

24
00:00:32,173 --> 00:00:33,768
Something falls from his coat.

25
00:00:33,818 --> 00:00:35,627
Otto's shop key.

26
00:00:35,857 --> 00:00:37,157
His door slams.

27
00:00:37,207 --> 00:00:39,587
A room you were never invited into.

28
00:00:39,736 --> 00:00:41,241
Safwan grabs your arm.

29
00:00:41,291 --> 00:00:41,921
You knew.

30
00:00:41,971 --> 00:00:43,139
How did you know?

31
00:00:43,189 --> 00:00:45,581
He's pulled you back in front of the mirror.

32
00:00:45,631 --> 00:00:46,401
In the glass,

33
00:00:46,451 --> 00:00:48,469
his hand is gripping nothing.

34
00:00:48,859 --> 00:00:50,849
Then the tavern door bursts open.

35
00:00:50,899 --> 00:00:51,959
Captain Grete.

36
00:00:52,009 --> 00:00:53,338
Three lanterns.

37
00:00:53,388 --> 00:00:54,508
She asks Safwan,

38
00:00:54,558 --> 00:00:55,646
where is he?

39
00:00:55,715 --> 00:00:57,390
Safwan opens his mouth.

40
00:00:57,440 --> 00:00:58,963
And looks at the mirror.

41
00:00:59,433 --> 00:01:01,458
What do you do before he speaks?

42
00:01:01,508 --> 00:01:04,147
Top comment chooses your next move.
